    <hr>
      <p>At the Vulpera Ecological Collective, our projects focus on ecological research, habitat restoration, wildlife
        protection, and public education. Our work spans multiple regions and ecosystems, with the goal of protecting
        biodiversity and inspiring future generations to care for the natural world. Below are some of our key projects
        that we are currently working on or have planned for the near future. We invite you to explore these initiatives and
        learn more about how we are making a difference in the world of conservation.</p>
